{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55272","headline":"长兴中题杜光寺（题拟） · 王仁裕","name":"长兴中题杜光寺（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上尔高僧更不疑，梦乘龙驾落沉晖。\n寒暄晕映琉璃殿，晓夜摧残毳衲衣。\n金体几生传有漏，玉容三界自无非。\n莓苔满院人稀到，松畔香台野鹤飞。\n（见元骆天骧《类编长安志》寺观类杜光寺条，云长兴中王仁裕题诗云云。\n据《中国古都研究》收黄永年先生《述〈类编长安志〉》转录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王仁裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55272.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55272","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}